attr[seg000:0086]: name = draw_game_ui; comment = Draw the in-game UI/HUD: set fb1 active + clear it, draw every HUD element from _word_20F94_ui_elements via draw_all_ui_elements (offscreen through gfx_call_bp_with_front_buffer_as_screen), then overlay the hud head-and-shoulders (ui_hud_head_draw). Reused standalone from seg000:3768 to redraw the HUD.
