attr[seg000:071d]: type = code; name = intro_41_play_VER_HNM; comment = [[[
    Intro stage 41 play. Start the looping SN8.VOC (al=8, audio_start_voc), then run VER.HNM to
    completion in a blocking loop: each time hnm_do_frame advances a frame, hnm_blit_frame_to_screen
    (loc_04b16) copies it to the screen and hnm_end_voc_loop_check_complete (loc_04937) ends the VOC
    loop at frame 0x0b and reports completion; also breaks on user input.
]]]
