attr[seg000:31f6]: type = code; name = troop_prepare_troop_data_for_condit; fn = in troop: *Troop @si; comment = [[[
    Stage the troops CONDIT block (ds:2c..4b) for the troop dialogue and the map
    info panel, then the troops location block (prepare_location_data_for_condit).
    It also stages the string_subst_id_table entries the placeholders in those
    strings expand to:
      0x83 subst_id_03 = field_E low byte + 0xe8 - the equipment name.
      0x84 subst_id_04 = (occupation & 0xf) + 0x18 - the occupation caption.
      0x85 subst_id_05 = the duration phrase (sub_032c7).
      0x86/0x87/0x88 subst_id_06..08 = the spice/army/ecology skill captions.
      0x8a subst_id_0a = the dissatisfaction low nibble.
]]]
