attr[seg000:32c7]: type = code; name = troop_prepare_troop_data_for_condit_sub_032c7; fn = in troop: *Troop @si; comment = [[[
    The ralliement clocks: ds:42 = game_time - time_period_of_ralliement and
    ds:41 = that >> 4 (whole days).
    It also picks subst_id_05, the 0x85 duration phrase: "but our job is
    finished" (0x74) for occupation bit 4, else "for a very short time" (0x70,
    < 3 periods), "for a few hours" (0x71, < 0x10), "for 1 day" (0x72, < 0x20)
    or "for 12 days" (0x73), whose digits are overwritten in the resource with
    the day count.
]]]
