    Per standing room-person (called from run_room_leave_dialogue_scan / per-frame).
    Present their topic-4 auto-dialogue line via present_room_person_dialogue; if a
    line was spoken (carry clear), fall through to install the speaker's dialogue verb
    menu: loc_03595 calls set_dialogue_speaker (93df) + play_pending_panel_fold
    (0d280) for the data_00023 == 1 room-leave case (== 3/== 4 take the
    come-with-me/special menus). data_047a7 latches so only one person speaks per scan.
]]]
