attr[seg000:3a73]: type = code; name = draw_ornis; fn = inout count: u16 @cx, inout x: u16 @dx, inout y: u16 @bx; comment = [[[
    The step-first entry of the parked-orni draw loop: advance one pad slot
    (+0x46, +0x0a) and loop-decrement BEFORE drawing, so count - 1 ornis draw
    at slots 2..count. The takeoff frames (orni_anim_draw_frame) enter here to
    leave the departing orni's first slot empty; the room pass enters at
    draw_ornis_loop and draws all count slots.
]]]
