attr[seg000:4305]: name = map_screen_open_with_cancel_menu; ofs_seg = seg001; comment = [[[
    Open the map/globe main view with the single-entry Cancel command menu
    (bp = menu_multiple_cancel). Shared tail of TAKE AN ORNITHOPTER (seg000:42e9)
    and CALL A WORM (seg000:42d1); falls through into map_screen_open.
]]]
attr[seg000:430b]: name = map_screen_open; ofs_seg = seg000; comment = [[[
    Open the map/globe main view. bp = the command-menu record buffer to fold in.
    Pushes a screen element with cleanup func map_screen_cleanup, installs the map
    mouse handlers (mouse_handlers_01ac8) and the alternate nav panel (data_01cca,
    via data_046eb = 1), copies the map window rect template (data_0149c) into
    data_046e3_rect, draws the screen base (map_screen_draw_base), starts the
    "select destination" narration clip 0x2bc, arms the SELECT DESTINATION ON MAP
    text task, installs map_view_redraw as the main-view drawing function, draws
    the windowed map + location markers, and folds in the verb panel.
]]]
