attr[seg000:5a56]: type = code; name = callback_transition_05a56; comment = [[[
    The SEE DUNE MAP view builder, run inside the transition (seg000:5a2d).
    data_046eb bit 0x80 already set: only redraw (ui_main_view_map_interface).
    Fresh open: dismiss stacked overlays, suspend room swaps (loc_04aca), remove
    the globe frame tasks, arm the troop icon animation task
    (troop_icon_anim_task, interval 15), data_046e3_rect = the full-map rect
    (full_map_view_rect), draw the nested border, draw the HUD head, data_046eb =
    0x80, refresh the music (loc_0ad5e), troop icons drawn by depth
    (troop_icon_draw_order_func = troop_icons_pick_next_by_depth), install + run
    ui_main_view_map_interface as the main-view drawing function, draw the map
    frieze sides, and install the alternate nav panel (loc_0d712).
]]]
