attr[seg000:8308]: name = troop_travel_step; fn = in troop: *Troop @si; comment = [[[
    One time period of a moving troop (occupation bit 6): 4 sub-steps - 8 with
    an ornithopter (equipment bit 6) - each computed by troop_travel_substep_delta
    and added to the gps position; a zero delta is arrival (troop_arrive).
    Afterwards the map icon follows: off-screen it is removed; on-screen it is
    moved (loc_0c653 recentres it on the projected position), or spawned fresh
    from the moving-icon script and repainted (troop_icons_update_dirty_rect on
    the icon rect).
]]]
