attr[seg000:8357]: name = troop_arrive_at_destination; ofs_seg = seg001; fn = in troop: *Troop @si; comment = [[[
    A moving troop reached its destination: the prospector troop (troops[2])
    shifts ARRAY_PTR_Location_prospector_destinations when it arrives at its
    head; the gps snaps to the location coordinates. A battle-flagged (status
    bit 1) or Atreides location settles the troop (loc_083bc); becoming the
    chain head afterwards is the battle won (troop_location_07429), an
    espionage arrival (occupation 5) at a hidden location reveals it (status
    bit 7 cleared, location_05d44), anything else notifies the residents
    (troop_location_083fd). At a non-Atreides location: espionage/attack
    (occupation 5/6) drop to occupation 4 (troop_06ac5) and settle; an
    occupation with low bits 11b turns around instead (loc_0841f): return the
    borrowed equipment word [si+0xe] and head home to [si+0xc].
]]]
