attr[seg000:8831]: type = code; name = ui_click_map_buttons; fn = in button_state: u8 @al, in delta: *u16 @si; comment = [[[
    Scroll the map/globe view by the (delta longitude, delta latitude) word pair at si.
    al = the live button byte: only while the LMB is down (test al,1) — the final fire on
    the release edge is a no-op. The full-globe view (data_046eb bit 0x80) scrolls the globe
    instead: bit 0x40 moves globe_param_3/4 (loc_08858), else loc_05beb runs first.
    The plain windowed view adds the pair to zoomed_globe_longitude/latitude and falls into
    map_refresh_main_view.
]]]
