    Room menu active: person_hit_test_at_cursor (HUD-area cursor -> companion slots); person < 0fh dispatches room_persons[cl] handler (9234), >= 0fh the Fremen-2 dialogue (9240), 2fh the parked orni (9282); no hit in room 1 walks inside (9263).
    Dialogue panel active (9248): only the companion slots respond - the speaker own portrait re-enters their dialogue (callback_main_ui_element_19), the other companion switches the conversation (dismiss_stacked_overlays + 9234).
]]]
