attr[seg000:9285]: name = person_hit_test_at_cursor; comment = [[[
    Hit-test the cursor (dx = x, bx = y) against the on-screen person markers
    (character_screen_pos, seg001:47f8): a fixed box 1..=32 px right and 1..=80 px
    below each anchor. On a person hit: CF set, cx = person id (loc_092eb). When
    no person matches, test the parked-ornithopter hotspot (orni_hotspot_x/y,
    recorded by the draw_room_scene orni pass, 0 = none): a box 1..=78 px right
    and 0..=59 px below it; on a hit CF set, cx = 0x2f — the ornithopter
    pseudo-person id, whose 0x78 + id verb text (0xa7 = TAKE AN ORNITHOPTER)
    makes the hover highlight work with no special case. y >= 0x98 takes the
    menu_NPC_actions path at loc_092c9 instead.
]]]
