attr[seg000:92c9]: name = companion_slot_hit_test; fn = out carry: bool @cf; comment = [[[
    Hit-test the cursor against the two companion HUD portrait slots (ui_hud_elements[21]/[22]).
    An occupied slot (ui_hud_companion_N != 0ffh) whose rect strictly contains the cursor returns CF set with cx = that companion person index.
    An empty slot 1 ends the test without trying slot 2.
    Reached from person_hit_test_at_cursor when the cursor sits below the game area (y >= 98h) and from the dialogue branch of callback_main_ui_element_21_22 (924e).
]]]
