attr[seg000:94dd]: comment = [[[
    Multi-part continuation present (reached from 9484): interpolate + draw the pending text (loc_088d2), which re-arms or clears the pointer.
    current_subtitle_id += 0x1000 steps the voc part nibble (the OB/OC variant letter in create_voc_file_name).
    fire_event_callbacks then defers or performs the entry bookkeeping (a042) and its tail replays the head present + this part voice; loc_094a5 stores the (un)advanced resume pointer.
]]]
attr[seg000:9533]: type = code; name = menu_callback_choice_stay_here; comment = [[[
    STAY HERE verb handler (spliced in by setup_npc_dialogue_menu at seg000:910e once the NPC travels with Paul, text 92h).
    Arm the dialogue-interrupt gate, present the speaker's topic-6 line with the auto mask (20h), bump the ds:1b interaction counter.
    If no spoken-line event dropped the gate, clear the travelling state (falls into npc_clear_travelling); Chani during game phase 5dh additionally advances the troop illness cure (+10h) when ill troops are at her location.
]]]
attr[seg000:9556]: name = npc_clear_travelling; fn = in npc: *RoomPerson @si; comment = [[[
    Clear the room-person travelling state: drop the STAY-HERE verb flag (flags bit 40h), refresh time_dismissed (npc_refresh_travel_timestamp, bx=2), and clear the persons_travelling_with bit (rol of 0fffeh by person_index).
    Fallen into by menu_callback_choice_stay_here; also called from the travel-departure detach scan (seg000:40f2) and the companion-slot eviction in npc_assign_companion_slot (seg000:96a1).
]]]
attr[seg000:956d]: name = npc_refresh_travel_timestamp; fn = in npc: *RoomPerson @si, in which: u16 @bx; comment = [[[
    Refresh one of the room-person travel timestamps (time_joined at +8 for bx=0, time_dismissed at +0ah for bx=2).
    The rendered operands hide the asymmetry: the guard reads the OTHER word ([bp+si+8] with bp = bx^2) and the store writes THIS one ([bx+si+8]).
    Only when game_time minus the other timestamp is >= 2 ticks is [si+bx+8] set to game_time (a debounce against immediate re-toggling).
    loc_094f3 seeds for_condit_ds_16 from these words: time_joined while flags bit 40h (travelling) is set, time_dismissed otherwise.
]]]
attr[seg000:9584]: type = code
attr[seg000:95af]: comment = Overpower the prisoner.
attr[seg000:95c1]: type = code; name = menu_callback_choice_come_with_me_troop; comment = [[[
    Troop-leader COME WITH ME verb entry (installed by setup_npc_dialogue_menu at seg000:90ea for person 0eh, text 96h/97h).
    Runs the charisma check and records the outcome in pending_room_action for the topic-5 record's conditions, then falls into menu_callback_choice_come_with_me.
    Pass (ah=0) when data_000ac < 3e8h, or charisma > 100, or (100 - charisma)/4 <= for_condit_troop_motivation_modifier_ds_36; fail (ah=2) otherwise.
]]]
attr[seg000:95de]: comment = Record the come-with-me outcome: 0 if the charisma check passes, 2 if it fails.
attr[seg000:95e2]: type = code; name = menu_callback_choice_come_with_me; comment = [[[
    COME WITH ME verb handler (menu record data_01f84, text 91h).
    Arm the dialogue-interrupt gate, present the speaker's topic-5 line with the auto mask (20h), bump the ds:1b interaction counter and clear pending_room_action.
    If no spoken-line event dropped the gate (a refusal line carries the stay-here event 2), mark the speaker travelling: flags |= 40h (the verb flips to STAY HERE), refresh time_joined, and set their persons_travelling_with bit.
    A troop-leader speaker (person_index 0eh) instead rallies the troop (loc_0961b): troop_rally_troop_066ce, rebuild the room verb records, a Fremen-2 motivation bonus (+18h) when it is troops[2], then re-open the dialogue menu on Fremen 2 and fold the panel in.
]]]
attr[seg000:95f2]: comment = Clear the pending room-action after the come-with-me line has been presented.
