attr[seg000:9719]: name = map_present_troop_contact_line; comment = [[[
    Pick and present one line of the troop-contact dialogue: resume inside the
    record (dialogue_resume_entry_ptr) or start at [DIALOGUE + 122*2], the block
    every contacted troop speaks from. The speaker is always the generic Fremen
    head (current_lip_sync_resource_id = 0x0f, data_047a2 = room_persons[15]) and
    the sentence mask is 0x20. A walk that matched nothing resets the cursor so
    the next call restarts at the record head. In contact range the location also
    queues the message (messages_02a51, al = 0x0f).
]]]
