attr[seg000:9c90]: comment = [[[
    While a voice plays, clamp the diff-box bottom to the mouth-box top ([current_head_mouth_box]+2) so an idle blink/nod redraw never wipes the stamped mouth.
    A box left entirely inside the mouth region collapses (y1 <= y0 -> the 9cbf empty sentinel) and the redraw is skipped.
    BARO (9) and HARK (0ch) are exempt (9c88/9c8c): their mouth boxes sit near the top of the head and would collapse every redraw.
]]]
