attr[seg000:9ec0]: ofs_seg = seg001
attr[seg000:9ed5]: name = menu_callback_choice_what; comment = [[[
    The " WHAT ? " dialogue verb: replay the last-presented line's voice.
    For a room speaker (< 10h): settle the idle head animation to a frame boundary (loc_09985 spins frame_task_callback_099be until data_047ce & 7 == 0) and re-arm the portrait part-2 flag (data_047e1 81h -> 1).
    Then re-arm the NPC-menu idle timer and re-run loc_09efd with the saved voc-bank flag (data_047dc = data_047dd around the call): current_subtitle_id's .voc + lip-sync start over.
    Also the WHAT/repeat button of the narration/vision/book menus (data_01f88/1f98/1fa8/1fb4/1ff8/200c/20b0).
]]]
attr[seg000:9f31]: name = get_dialogue_topic_record; fn = in topic: u16 @ax, out record: u16 @si; comment = [[[
    Resolve the current speaker's topic-ax dialogue record: si = DIALOGUE[(data_047be & 0fff8h) + ax].
    Topic 5 = the COME WITH ME record, topic 6 = the STAY HERE record.
    Falls into loc_09f40, the shared per-presentation setup.
]]]
