attr[seg000:9f8b]: name = present_dialogue_line_with_auto_mask; comment = Present a dialogue line with the verb-eligibility mask data_047c2 forced to 20h (the auto/COME-WITH-ME mask), preserving the caller's mask around the call.
attr[seg000:9f9e]: name = present_first_matching_dialogue_line; comment = [[[
    Walk the dialogue record at si (4-byte sentence entries, 0xffff-terminated) and present the
    first entry whose condition holds: show the talking head (loc_09fd8, gated on data_046eb == 0
    and current_lip_sync_resource_id < 10h), record/draw the subtitle, then fall through into
    fire_event_callbacks_from_spoken_dialogue_lines_and_more (event callback + spoken mark + voice).
    Returns carry set when no entry matched (si at the terminator); carry clear after presenting a
    line, with si at the next entry (or 0ffffh when dialogue_end_request fired).
]]]
