attr[seg000:a8bc]: type = code; name = create_voc_file_name_from_bx; ofs_seg = seg001; comment = [[[Build the voice .voc filename P<L>\P<L><idx><suffix>.VOC at di=37dbh from bx (the rebased voc index) and bl (the speaker dir id, +0x41 = letter). suffix is O outdoor / I indoor-reverb (a8e1, the data_000ea/location gate). The trailing variant letter (a8ff) is (bx bits 12..15) OR data_047e0: for a multi-part line those high bits step per continuation (94e8 += 0x1000) giving O,OB,OC parts; for an altvoc line data_047e0 is a rand_masked(3) take, giving random O/OB/OC alternates.]]]
