]]]
attr[seg000:b147]: name = book_find_first_page; comment = [[[
    Find the first page of the dialogue-played log matching topic filter bx:
    seed si to the log base (cs:0xa8), one step (cx=1) forward (dx=2) and fall
    into book_find_page.
]]]
attr[seg000:b150]: name = book_find_page; comment = [[[
    Step cx pages through the dialogue-played log from cs:si by dx (2 forward,
    -2 backward; 0 means start at si, then forward). A page word's low 11 bits
    index the 4-byte dialogue record at ds:0xaa78; the record flag byte (+2)
    masked with bl must be 0 (untopiced) or equal bh to match the filter.
    Returns di = last matching page ptr, di=0 / ZF set when the terminator
    (low bits 0) is hit first.
]]]
attr[seg000:b17a]: name = run_game_phase_triggers; comment = [[[
    Run the game-phase trigger record with subtitle presentation suppressed: set data_000c6 bit 80h (the loc_0a034 gate then skips show_voice_subtitle) around present_game_phase_trigger_line, restoring the caller's flag after.
    Called on every phase change: startup (seg000:00b9/00bc, twice), set_game_phase_and_trigger_callbacks (seg000:122d), the event-0bh dialogue callback (seg000:a227), and seg000:2bc1.
]]]
attr[seg000:b18b]: type = code; name = callback_ui_element_book_close; comment = [[[
    Close the book (frieze hotspot, close-button sprite 33, and the Close book
    menu verb). Fade out the song, clear game_suspend_count and the book flags,
    hide hud element 23, close any credits HNM, remove the credits frame task,
    clear the bubble layout ptr, reopen PERS.HSQ and rejoin the common
    return-to-room path at loc_01877 (transition 0x34).
]]]
