attr[seg000:c7d4]: comment = [[[
    Preserve an open popup panel over a dirty-rect repaint (called from loc_0c7a2
    for map_popup_ptr, then map_popup2_ptr).
    si = the panel record (rect at +0..+7), di = the clip rect.
    Intersect the panel rect with the clip rect; an empty intersection returns.
    Copy the intersection from the visible screen (ds = screen_buffer_seg), where
    the popup is still intact, into fb1 (es = framebuffer_1_seg), the buffer the
    repaint composed in, before loc_0c7be publishes fb1 to the screen.
]]]
