attr[seg000:ccd7]: comment = [[[
    Talking-head clips (video id >= 0x19: IRULAN.HNM and the SEQ* heads) take
    the checkerboard 2x path at loc_0cce3 (gfx_vtable_vga_blit_checkerboard ->
    vga_blit_checkerboard, segvga:0133), which spreads the frame across a 2x
    region writing only even-col/even-row pixels. Lower ids use the 1:1 blit
    at ss:[38c9h] (gfx_vtable_vga_blit).
]]]
