attr[seg000:d7b7]: type = code; name = ui_hud_companion_blink_task; comment = [[[
    Per-game-loop-frame companion-portrait blink step (called from game_loop at seg000:d838), fired once per 64 PIT ticks (pit counter*4 high byte vs companion_blink_step_latch).
    Nonzero ui_hud_companion_blink counters are decremented; odd values temporarily overwrite the ui_hud_companion_1/2 pair with 0ffh (blank) around a ui_hud_draw_companions redraw, then the real pair is popped back.
    The redraw (ICONES bank reload + cursor restore/redraw bracket) only runs while ui_hud_elements[1].sprite_id == 0 (the left HUD hand at rest, i.e. the panel-side doors open); mid-fold the counters still tick silently.
]]]
