attr[seg001:0051]: type = u8; name = for_condit_location_status_ds_51; comment = [[[
    Bit    7: location has not been discovered.
    Bit    6: location area has been prospected.
    Bit    5: location has a wind-trap.
    Bit    4: location inventory can be seen.
    Bit    3: location is a conquered but not yet transformed Harkonnen fortress ? If set, the "Good to see these Harkonnens beaten off! Our Fremen are good warriors, and you are a great leader of men." message in Stilgar's dialogue and the "Paul, you are the only man able to make these Harkonnens step back. I'm proud to be at your side." message in Chani's dialogue are triggered; if clear, the "I don't think this is the place to do that." message in Fremen dialogue is triggered.
    Bit    2: location has saboteurs.
    Bit    1: location is in a battle.
    Bit    0: location has vegetation present (no more spice mining).
]]]
