attr[seg001:1454]: type = [u16; 5]; name = desert_step_deltas; comment = [[[
    Per-direction desert step deltas, indexed by bp = the compass direction (1..4,
    UP/RIGHT/DOWN/LEFT) or the negated special-exit byte (0xff..0xfb -> 1..5).
    Each word is a packed step: al = signed longitude delta, ah = signed
    fine-latitude delta, applied by desert_apply_step_delta. Entries (from index
    1): UP/0xff = lat -1, RIGHT/0xfe = lon +1, DOWN/0xfd = lat +1, LEFT/0xfc =
    lon -1, 0xfb = no movement (step onto the map in place). Index 0 is unused
    (the word there, 0x0209, is unrelated data).
]]]
attr[seg001:145e]: name = map_scroll_delta_up; comment = The four (delta longitude, delta latitude) word pairs the nav-panel arrows scroll by: up (0,-12), right (+0x1002,0), down (0,+12), left (-0x1002,0).
