attr[seg001:1d1e]: type = [UIElement; 6]; name = ui_nav_panel_blank; comment = [[[
    The blank navigation-panel template: six records with no sprite and no handler, so installing it clears the bottom-right compass.
    Installed for the LOOK AT MIRROR still, for a staged night attack, and during a travel that cannot be steered (a location destination, or data_011ca held by an overlay).
]]]
attr[seg001:1d72]: type = [UIElement; 6]; name = ui_nav_panel_flight; comment = [[[
    The in-flight navigation-panel template (game_screen_mode_flags & 3): turn left (sprite 42, callback_ui_element_04ad0), the flight/resume button (sprite 43, menu_callback_choice_resume_flight) and turn right (sprite 44, callback_ui_element_04ad7).
    Only installed while the flight is steerable — travel_no_location_dest != 0; a flight homing on a location gets ui_nav_panel_blank instead.
]]]
