    then OR mask u16x16). Init points to cursor_shape_arrow.
    redraw_mouse xchg-swaps in the shape get_mouse_cursor_image_addr selects.
]]]
attr[seg001:2584]: type = CursorShape; name = cursor_shape_arrow; comment = [[[
    Default arrow cursor shape: hotspot (0,0), then AND mask u16x16 then OR mask u16x16.
    Per pixel (MSB = leftmost): AND set = transparent (keep background);
    AND clear + OR set = colour 0x0f; AND clear + OR clear = black.
]]]
