attr[seg001:47de]: type = u16; name = dialogue_line_word0; comment = [[[
    First word (word0) of the sentence entry being presented = [si] (flags/event byte) | [si+1] (condition id low 8) << 8.
    Low-byte flag bits: 0x0f event-callback id (a049, table a107); 0x10 randomized voice take, the line has several recorded variants and rand_masked(3) (89dd) picks one (0..3) into data_047e0 that create_voc_file_name_from_bx (a8ff) appends as a variant letter to the .voc name, latched off after use (8ac6); 0x20 auto-dialogue skip bit (9fba, mask 0x20); 0x40 always-offer, exempt from the spoken/mask skip (9fb6); 0x80 spoken mark (a097).
]]]
