attr[seg001:dd02]: type = u8; name = globe_draw_skips_pixel_stores; comment = [[[
    Globe pixel-store skip flag, read into al by map_func_gfx (seg000:b97e).
    BSS, so 0 at startup and outside the map screen.
    0: vga_globe_init patches its data_segvga_01e4a slot with two NOPs - every globe pixel is computed and stored (the full redraw the intro2 scene uses).
    nonzero: the slot gets a short jmp that skips the pixel store path.
]]]
